      propertyPath: 'DialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I swear it wasn't ,my fault!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8166210344723503398, guid: a6b7a812b2f3eb44ab6433ee503c138e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueWords.Array.data[0]'
      value: Is this the way out?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8166210344723503398, guid: a6b7a812b2f3eb44ab6433ee503c138e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueWords.Array.data[1]'
      value: What a way to start a conversation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8166210344723503398, guid: a6b7a812b2f3eb44ab6433ee503c138e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueWords.Array.data[2]'
      value: Tsk, doesn't matter.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8166210344723503398, guid: a6b7a812b2f3eb44ab6433ee503c138e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueWords.Array.data[3]'
      value: Well to awnser your question, yes this is the way out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8166210344723503398, guid: a6b7a812b2f3eb44ab6433ee503c138e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueWords.Array.data[4]'
      value: But unless you've got some strange power.
